[[2047,31,0,"<h3>Functional description</h3><p>The headlamp washer \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>J50</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               is supplied (pin 30) by the direct\nline from the battery through the headlamp washer fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B12</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               and\nthe maxifuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>J/B2</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               of \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B5</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               up to 2/99 or of \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                      