 \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              ).</p><p>With the side lights on, a signal reaches\npin 56 of \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>J50</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               from the steering column switch unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>H5</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               line.\n(\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <a href=\"#/3233770\">E2010</a>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              ).</p><p>When there are both signals at pins S and\n56, the relay, inside the device \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>J50</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               which supplies the electric\nheadlamp washer pump \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>N25</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               with impulses of about half a second,\nis energized for a certain time.</p>"]]